cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Post-Credit Solar Payback Index 2026"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-05"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://watt-guide.com/guides/solar-payback-by-state-2026"
repository-artifact: "https://watt-guide.com/assets/data/solar-payback-index-2026.csv"
abstract: >-
  Residential solar simple payback for all 50 US states, recomputed after the 30% federal
  tax credit (Section 25D) expired on 31 December 2025. Built from EIA residential rates,
  NREL PVWatts peak sun hours, statewide net-metering regime and EnergySage installed cost,
  applying one identical formula to every state.
keywords:
  - solar
  - photovoltaics
  - payback
  - net metering
  - electricity prices
  - United States
authors:
